  "notes": "Noise control on standard SPP, GAIA-shaped frames with vendor 000A and no checksum; firmware TW600-3091_20250919_v0.4.1. Get 0315 is answered by 8315 <status 00> <value>: 00 off, 01 noise cancelling, 02 transparency. Set 0314 <value> is not acknowledged and the get answers the old value until the change is done (0.7-2.1 s), so the bridge asks again every second until the earbuds agree. The frames fed here are section 5 of the capture, tools/earfun_probe.py --cycle anc,ambient,off. The battery is on the Fast Pair stream, not here.",
